            <description><![CDATA[<h2>A lighter settings interface</h2>
<ul><li>Data removal actions now use Cove’s standard outlined buttons, with the same confirmation before deleting anything.</li><li>Smaller supporting text and clearer type hierarchy give Settings and Integrations more breathing room.</li><li>Upcoming integrations and connection notes stay visually secondary.</li></ul>
]]></description>
