            <description><![CDATA[<h2>One settings section at a time</h2>
<ul><li>Select Gmail, Jev, Reading, Cloud sync, Privacy, or App updates in the sidebar to see only that section.</li><li>Focused pages replace the long settings list and top-level accordions.</li><li>Advanced connection options remain tucked away, and switching sections keeps your credential edits.</li></ul>
]]></description>
